      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@@{66e5d758eb4f6699821b78da|full_name} What's going on here is that to you, the head bone is scaled to [0,0,0] with everything inside; this is to prevent seeing your head. This issue is every simple to fix as you should just use the headchop component: https://creators.vrchat.com/avatars/avatar-dynamics/vrc-headchop",
